Task: Using the 2018 5-Year American Community Survey (ACS) for median incomes at the census tract level and the 2020 Federal Election Commission (FEC) individual contributions dataset filtered for donors in New York, matched to census tract geographies via a ZIP code to census tract crosswalk, calculate and list the average political donation amount and the median income for each census tract located in Kings County (Brooklyn), New York. 

